      "title": "Starting a New Hobby",
      "text": "Many people decide to take up a new hobby when they want to change their routine. It is a great way to meet new people (1) ________ share the same interests. Whether you choose painting, cooking, or learning a musical instrument, the most important thing is to enjoy (2) ________ you are doing. Some people worry that they are not good enough at the start, but everyone has to begin somewhere. It is often a good idea to join a local club (3) ________ you can get advice from more experienced members. If you prefer to learn alone, there are plenty of online videos that can help you improve (4) ________ own pace. Don't be afraid to try something completely different from your usual work; it might (5) ________ exactly what you need to relax. Once you start, you will likely wonder (6) ________ you didn't begin sooner.",
